{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>DECEIVED</i></strong>\u00a0is a <i>psychological horror</i> game. You find yourself in a loop, but every time you loop, something changes, it looks the same, but is it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore, find clues and collectibles that will help you  reveal the truth of what really happened that night inside the Walker residence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978520/extras/f574709ef3dddc0af5c98d06a205f1b2.poster.avif?t=1761642145\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978520/extras/f574709ef3dddc0af5c98d06a205f1b2.webm?t=1761642145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978520/extras/f574709ef3dddc0af5c98d06a205f1b2.mp4?t=1761642145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>IMMERSIVE HORROR EXPERIENCE</i></strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Am I hallucinating? or is it real?&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created inside a <strong><i>MODIFIED</i></strong>\u00a0<strong>UNREAL ENGINE 5 VERSION</strong> to deliver realistic and deeply immersive atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(dont worry, I optimized it :) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978520/extras/64c58d70f88c7fd257db4c87eb52ee5f.poster.avif?t=1761642145\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978520/extras/64c58d70f88c7fd257db4c87eb52ee5f.webm?t=1761642145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978520/extras/64c58d70f88c7fd257db4c87eb52ee5f.mp4?t=1761642145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>PUZZLES AND CLUES</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;What was that?&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find clues and solve puzzles whilst exploring the eerie hallways to uncover the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978520/extras/7bbe8acb73df0d30061789a8fc06864c.poster.avif?t=1761642145\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978520/extras/7bbe8acb73df0d30061789a8fc06864c.webm?t=1761642145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978520/extras/7bbe8acb73df0d30061789a8fc06864c.mp4?t=1761642145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>NEVER ENDING LOOP</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;I just went through this door, why am I in the same place?&quot;</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time you loop, the environment changes, interact with the environment and experience the horror of the Walker residence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978520/extras/c267948ff0161d1160cd0eeb3c5a7ebc.poster.avif?t=1761642145\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978520/extras/c267948ff0161d1160cd0eeb3c5a7ebc.webm?t=1761642145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978520/extras/c267948ff0161d1160cd0eeb3c5a7ebc.mp4?t=1761642145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>STORY-RICH GAMEPLAY</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;That, that can't be.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carefully crafted story and gameplay enhance immersion and amplify the horror.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3978520?t=1761642145","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3978520?t=1761642145","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978520/3b9fb467cb7536b8855218599f79035f3e43cd79/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761642145","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978520/3b9fb467cb7536b8855218599f79035f3e43cd79/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761642145","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>DECEIVED</i></strong>\u00a0is a <i>psychological horror</i> game. You find yourself in a loop, but every time you loop, something changes, it looks the same, but is it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore, find clues and collectibles that will help you  reveal the truth of what really happened that night inside the Walker residence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978520/extras/f574709ef3dddc0af5c98d06a205f1b2.poster.avif?t=1761642145\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.co